,"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T10:30:58Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T10:30:58Z","body":"I mean the usecase is kinda a collateral damage of the change, but it's working as intended.\n\nThe only way Godot was able to support this was by actually running `instantiate` during the completion process. This was not safe and can lead to critical side effects:\n- memory leaks + crashes (e.g. by leaking low level rendering resources)\n- executing tool scripts in a context which no author of toolscripts does account for\n- triggering expensive operations and slowing down the editor\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3686105316/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3686486712","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114256#issuecomment-3686486712","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114256","id":3686486712,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bu1K4","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T12:31:39Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T12:34:36Z","body":"I added a class_name to the scene’s script, and it surprised me that the auto-completion works perfectly when I preload the script instead of the scene itself. That got me thinking: could we assign an anonymous class name (which is temporary) to a scene’s attached script (if the script doesn’t already have a user-defined class_name), and then use that anonymous/user-defined class’s auto-completion to provide the scene’s auto-completion options?\n\n<img width=\"492\" height=\"245\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d9e0bba5-2ca5-4dd5-96e4-0a580dca8fb2\" />\n\n```\nextends Node2D\nclass_name XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX_FDFS\n\n@export var prop1: int\n@export var prop2: int\n@export var prop3: int\n\nfunc foo():\n\tpass\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3686486712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3686507915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114256#issuecomment-3686507915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114256","id":3686507915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bu6WL","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T12:39:57Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T12:41:38Z","body":"Update: we don't even need to add an anonymous class name. \n\n<img width=\"518\" height=\"373\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cdb5bc34-d088-417a-8c45-0bd88e5c55e9\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3686507915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]